{'symbol': 'BRO', 'date': '2019-10-31 22:30:00', 'title': 'DAVID PUTZ NAMES AS EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF ARROWHEAD GENERAL INSURANCE AGENCY, INC. AND AS A LEADER WITH BROWN & BROWN’S NATIONAL PROGRAMS DIVISION', 'text': 'BROWN & BROWN, INC. HAS ANNOUNCED THAT DAVID PUTZ HAS BEEN NAMED EXECUTIVE VICE PRESIDENT OF ARROWHEAD GENERAL INSURANCE AGENCY, INC. AND A LEADER WITH BROWN & BROWN’S NATIONAL PROGRAMS DIVISION. PUTZ JOINS THE COMPANY FROM ZURICH INSURANCE NORTH AMERICA, HAVING BEEN AT ZURICH FOR OVER 24 YEARS. IN HIS MOST RECENT ROLE, PUTZ SERVED AS HEAD OF ALTERNATIVE MARKETS AND WAS RESPONSIBLE FOR OVER $7 BILLIONOF WRITTEN PREMIUM. IN HIS NEW ROLE, PUTZ WILL BE WORKING DIRECTLY WITH CHRIS WALKER, PRESIDENT OF BROWN & BROWN NATIONAL PROGRAMS, AND THE LEADERSHIP TEAM AT ARROWHEAD.'}